Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪\NThe dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪\NI won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪\NA red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪\NGalloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Sore ga atashi ♪\NThat’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪\NThe Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪\NTruly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi nano sa ♪\NIt’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Ninth Episode\NThe Melted Icicle\NThe Last of the Snow Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Queen Icicle of Coolland was a cold-hearted woman.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They sent a fake Sapphire to take over Silverland,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}leaving the real Sapphire unable to even enter the castle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, the Coolland army finally mobilizes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With their new weapon, the Iron Lion, they surge toward the border for battle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All by themselves, Sapphire and Tink defeated the Iron Lion{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and crushed the massive enemy army.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But Tink had disappeared.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire was at a loss.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's when Hecate arrived.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They say Mephisto is about to smash the petrified King and Queen{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}on Sea Snake Island!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This week's story begins here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.10,0:02:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please sit back and enjoy the show.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.93,0:02:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,how awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,how terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:02:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrifying queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.67,0:03:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Build the second Iron Lion right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a messenger to Crystal Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen who ordered a weapon like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a terrifying woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize that young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For the crime of speaking ill of the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting buried under the dirt saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire must be worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ask Tori-san and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:03:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here of my own free will!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save my parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you swear never to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear on this sword, I won't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.64,0:04:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuborosha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.52,0:04:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My King!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I could swear I heard Sapphire's voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Uraisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, aren't you going to send Sapphire's parents back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then those people will starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's humans among the Sea Serpent People!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A sea serpent man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look... The ones on the island are the King and Queen of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dispatch a ship at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not suspicious people!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you will be reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Into a fearless witch with a strong heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the long-awaited, thrilling moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Storm, howl to celebrate the birth of a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shriek!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.07,0:06:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are going numb!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sea Snake Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So Mephisto really did send Father and the others back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt a demon could be that kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm heading back to Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sand Glass migratory birds are crossing the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the entrance to the secret passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we going in through the secret passage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an impostor of me inside the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be in big trouble if we get kicked out like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Going left leads to the Cave Hall... It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This one moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an old well over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:08:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, how creepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You! Somebody, get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe now that we've made it this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.51,0:09:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just Taka-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.97,0:09:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof, so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:09:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Father and the others were captured at the Snow Castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.49,0:10:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, we captured the King and Queen of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.91,0:10:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all according to Her Majesty's wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, Her Majesty will send a message
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,demanding Silverland's surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You will go to Coolland Castle posing as Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and seal the document as proof of surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't surrender, the King and Queen will be in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I save Father and Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,without having our kingdom surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know either...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but as long as we defeat the Snow Queen, nobody can complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Snow Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter how strong Sapphire is, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is surrounded by soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.69,0:11:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be easy for me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to pose as the fake Sapphire and go see the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.91,0:11:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no... It'll be terrible if Sapphire dies...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there some way to deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Taka-kun went home...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask Peter in the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Peter-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Crystal Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Crystal Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of allies for Sapphire there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.87,0:12:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when I was captured, Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was so nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a single bad person there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.89,0:12:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They opposed the Snow Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They got thrown in a place like that just for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.69,0:12:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get them out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure they'll support Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your instincts to find the field mouse's hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Nezumi in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, can I ask you guys a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Locked 'em tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today, you bastards work in this valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Sapphire is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen's messenger must be following us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Fake Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That Nylon thinks I'm a fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can drop the mask now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Freeze very will be pleased!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That fake princess puts on quite an act!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.79,0:14:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's just the two of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to your normal self and talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know that man's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I fool them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you staying quiet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You miserable fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She has her eyes on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I talk like I usually do, Lady Freeze will chew me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm not talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Lady Freeze is terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at Coolland Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether we can make it out alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never save Father and the others if I'm this weak-minded!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.85,0:15:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I must become much, much stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you dawdling for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more to the tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's straight to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You bastard! Don't slack off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terrified of mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.24,0:16:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna jump out of my skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, little mice, go! Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear those arrogant guards to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Little mouse, little mouse...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer on Sapphire, and let's defeat the Snow Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.99,0:17:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They still think I'm an impostor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, fake Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am deeply honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in this room knows you're the fake Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:17:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourself comfortable and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you stamp your seal here, Silverland will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the King and Queen really imprisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Duke Duralumin is deeply concerned and ordered me to go check on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What a faint-hearted man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me show you the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.57,0:18:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What foolish people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:18:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's impossible... It must be Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:19:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, stay quiet...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off your mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.61,0:19:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.71,0:19:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you standing around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you value the Queen's life, open the cell!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So you really are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm the real Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll show you my other face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the Knight of the Ribbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.87,0:19:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I hold the Queen hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.02,0:19:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:19:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:19:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She was stalling!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lasting far too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.14,0:20:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The water... Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The water from Lake Ore...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.11,0:20:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The water's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn those prisoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:20:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to overthrow the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear down the Queen's castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! Here! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat the Snow Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.53,0:21:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're breaking in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are the guards doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the guards are turning against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They've joined the townsfolk to attack us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to flee, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.89,0:21:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you'll end up like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.62,0:21:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:21:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.53,0:22:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That fountain is a secret passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.34,0:22:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze and the Snow Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.94,0:22:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.76,0:22:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.73,0:22:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.84,0:22:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:22:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.78,0:23:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.84,0:23:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.03,0:23:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who were saved by all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.20,0:23:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live Freeland! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.50,0:23:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.91,0:23:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.94,0:23:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted a little affection...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.06,0:23:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The King is coming!
